 "intro": [
  "\"The first to resettle their own property\" after the exile (9:2): heads of families from Judah and Benjamin, priests, Levites and gatekeepers. Each is introduced by his ancestry (\"Uthai son of Ammihud, son of Omri…\"), shown here from the earliest named ancestor down. A close parallel list is Nehemiah 11.",
  "How each family joins its tribe is not stated; a dashed line marks it."
 ],
 "sources": "Hebrew names: Miqra according to the Masorah. Parallel: Nehemiah 11:3–19. Scholarly summary after the standard commentaries.",
